ure and the length of each session.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need a chiller for contrast therapy?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The Salus Saunas Ice Bath is designed for a simple water-and-ice fill. The Snowpiercer and Dynamic include a cold/heat chiller with Wi-Fi app control that holds the temperature you set, which makes regular sessions easier.\"}}]}]}</script>",
